semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">WEBP to JPG</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Convert WEBP images into JPG format online for free.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/webp-to-png\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">WEBP to PNG</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Convert WEBP images into PNG format online for free.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/jpg-to-webp\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">JPG to WEBP</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Convert JPG images into WEBP format online for free.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/png-to-webp\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">PNG to WEBP</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Convert PNG images into WEBP format online for free.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/compress-image\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Compress Image</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Reduce image file size online for free while keeping good quality.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/resize-image\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Resize Image</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Resize images online for free. Change image width and height while maintaining quality.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/crop-image\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Crop Image</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Crop images online for free. Select a custom area and download the cropped image instantly.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/rotate-image\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Rotate Image</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Rotate images online for free. Turn JPG, PNG or WEBP images 90, 180 or 270 degrees and download instantly.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/image-to-base64\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Image to Base64</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Convert images to Base64 online for free. Encode JPG, PNG or WEBP images into Base64 text instantly.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/favicon-generator\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Favicon Generator</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Create website favicons from JPG, PNG or WEBP images online for free.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/watermark-image\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Watermark Image</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Add text watermark to images online for free. Protect JPG, PNG and WEBP images instantly.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/flip-image\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Flip Image</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Flip images horizontally or vertically online for free.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/grayscale-image\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Grayscale Image</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Convert JPG, PNG or WEBP images to grayscale online for free.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/meme-generator\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Meme Generator</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Create a classic meme image with top and bottom text online for free.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/avif-to-png\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">AVIF to PNG</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Convert AVIF images to PNG in your browser using native image decoding.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/avif-to-jpg\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">AVIF to JPG</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Convert AVIF images to JPG in your browser using native image decoding.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-white/10 bg-slate-900/40 px-6 py-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black\">Why use these tools?</h2><div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2\"><p class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60 p-6 leading-7 text-slate-300\">Convert common image formats without installing desktop software.</p><p class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60 p-6 leading-7 text-slate-300\">Edit and inspect images with browser-based tools that keep workflows quick.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"px-6 py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black\">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class=\"mt-8 space-y-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-bold\">Which image formats are supported?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-400\">Available tools cover JPG, JPEG, PNG, WEBP and supported AVIF workflows.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-bold\">Are images uploaded?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-400\">Image tools are designed to process files locally in your browser where supported.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-bold\">Can I use these tools on mobile?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-400\">Yes. Modern mobile browsers can use the tools, although very large images may need more memory.</p></div></div><h2 class=\"mt-16 text-2xl font-black\">Explore other categories</h2><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500/60\" href=\"/pdf-tools\">PDF Tools</a><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500/60\" href=\"/video-tools\">Video Tools</a><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500/60\" href=\"/audi